      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">35 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Backtracking</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Bitmask</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/sudoku-solver/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 37</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Sudoku Solver</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Fill the blanks one at a time with a digit that does not clash with its row, column or 3x3 box; when a blank has no legal digit, undo the last choice and try the next one. Three arrays of 9-bit masks make the clash test O(1) and the undo a single XOR. Worst case is exponential, but pruning makes real puzzles finish in milliseconds.</p>\n"
  },
